WEBVTT

00:01:47.950 --> 00:01:50.700
You'll definitely remember, Kaito!

00:02:02.390 --> 00:02:03.180
Seira!

00:02:07.500 --> 00:02:12.170
Seira, I'll definitely get your orange heart shards back!

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:15.200
Embrace Me...

00:02:27.960 --> 00:02:30.190
Rina-chan, are you bored?

00:02:30.210 --> 00:02:33.940
Of course not! The sea breeze feels wonderful.

00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:36.620
I never get tired of seeing the ocean.

00:02:37.150 --> 00:02:39.960
Hey, Rina-chan. Are you hungry?

00:02:40.110 --> 00:02:43.510
Yeah. Now that you mention it, it's almost lunch time.

00:02:43.760 --> 00:02:44.940
Do you want to eat a packed lunch?

00:02:45.400 --> 00:02:47.000
I made it.

00:02:47.050 --> 00:02:48.200
You made it?

00:02:48.480 --> 00:02:53.150
It looks a bit messed up, but it should taste good.

00:02:53.380 --> 00:02:56.270
Then I'll take my chances and try one.

00:03:00.660 --> 00:03:01.810
It's delicious!

00:03:02.010 --> 00:03:04.050
Masahiro, it's really delicious!

00:03:05.170 --> 00:03:05.970
You think so?

00:03:09.280 --> 00:03:12.400
Rina-chan, was it wrong to take you out to sea?

00:03:12.470 --> 00:03:14.180
Huh? Why?

00:03:14.310 --> 00:03:17.600
Didn't you say that you couldn't swim? Aren't you scared?

00:03:17.680 --> 00:03:20.030
Oh, I'm fine. I'm not scared.

00:03:20.380 --> 00:03:26.200
Who would have guessed? You're really good at sports, but the only thing you're not good at is swimming.

00:03:26.410 --> 00:03:28.760
I almost drowned when I was little.

00:03:28.960 --> 00:03:31.840
From then on, I've had an aversion to swimming.

00:03:35.420 --> 00:03:38.610
Rina-chan is having that far-away look again.

00:03:43.400 --> 00:03:44.400
Masahiro...

00:03:44.680 --> 00:03:48.510
Rina-chan, you'll always be by my side, right?

00:03:49.220 --> 00:03:52.440
You often have that far-away look, like just now.

00:03:53.360 --> 00:03:57.110
Every time I see you look like that, I feel uncomfortable.

00:03:57.700 --> 00:04:00.680
I feel like you'll go somewhere really far away.

00:04:03.590 --> 00:04:04.410
Rina-chan.

00:04:07.190 --> 00:04:08.130
Rina-chan...

00:04:14.800 --> 00:04:18.290
Stop expecting that you'll always be showered in gifts!

00:04:18.320 --> 00:04:18.700
Oh my.

00:04:19.130 --> 00:04:25.230
As for this ball of light, if you don't deliver results, you'd better watch out.

00:04:25.280 --> 00:04:28.500
Quit the jabbering and give that ball of light to me.

00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:32.740
Hehe!

00:04:32.810 --> 00:04:37.660
That's the ball of light that I asked Mikeru-sama to give me!

00:04:37.740 --> 00:04:38.530
Hand it over!

00:04:38.660 --> 00:04:41.750
You're stealing achievements from your colleagues.

00:04:41.820 --> 00:04:43.480
Hurry up and give it to me!

00:04:43.630 --> 00:04:45.040
Ugh! How scary!

00:04:46.650 --> 00:04:52.210
With this, I'll definitely trash the Mermaid Princesses this time.

00:04:52.390 --> 00:04:54.300
It'd be nice if that were the case.

00:05:01.730 --> 00:05:02.620
Are you tired?

00:05:02.750 --> 00:05:04.760
Nope, I'm fine.

00:05:05.200 --> 00:05:06.400
I'll take you home.

00:05:06.640 --> 00:05:08.520
Okay. Thank you.

00:05:13.770 --> 00:05:16.730
Wouldn't it be better if I took you home on my motorcycle?

00:05:17.220 --> 00:05:20.870
Oh no. We'll be there in no time with the motorcycle.

00:05:21.480 --> 00:05:24.470
I want to be with you a bit longer.

00:05:24.800 --> 00:05:25.590
Rina-chan...

00:05:28.070 --> 00:05:31.840
Hey, Papa! Let's go to the amusement park next time!

00:05:32.150 --> 00:05:34.700
I want to ride the merry-go-round!

00:05:33.070 --> 00:05:38.020
I wonder if we'll be like that {husband and wife }ten years from now?

00:05:40.980 --> 00:05:43.380
There won't be a "ten years from now" for us.

00:05:43.480 --> 00:05:45.290
Eh? Rina-chan?

00:05:45.570 --> 00:05:47.310
I've been really naïve.

00:05:48.050 --> 00:05:51.800
I thought that as long as I was happy now, I wouldn't need to think about the future.

00:05:52.640 --> 00:05:55.550
I shouldn't have gone out with you, Masahiro.

00:05:55.600 --> 00:05:57.720
What are you saying, Rina-chan?

00:05:58.000 --> 00:06:00.680
Let's not see each other anymore.

00:06:00.760 --> 00:06:02.340
Huh? No way.

00:06:03.540 --> 00:06:04.300
I'm sorry.

00:06:05.710 --> 00:06:07.980
Rina-chan! What's with you all of a sudden?

00:06:08.080 --> 00:06:09.540
I don't understand!

00:06:10.560 --> 00:06:12.320
I figured that you wouldn't understand.

00:06:12.650 --> 00:06:16.400
But we can no longer be together.

00:06:17.070 --> 00:06:18.720
Goodbye, Masahiro.

00:06:19.260 --> 00:06:20.130
Rina-chan...

00:06:29.620 --> 00:06:33.400
Hmm... Rina and Masahiro's future...

00:06:33.450 --> 00:06:34.390
I'm home.

00:06:34.670 --> 00:06:36.440
Welcome home, Rina.

00:06:36.820 --> 00:06:40.240
Where did you go on your date today with Hamasaki-san?

00:06:40.470 --> 00:06:42.330
We went to the ocean on a yacht.

00:06:42.460 --> 00:06:44.910
Eh!? Really?

00:06:45.110 --> 00:06:47.920
How wonderful, to ride on a yacht!

00:06:48.070 --> 00:06:50.190
I would've tagged along if I knew.

00:06:50.320 --> 00:06:52.160
Wait a minute, Hanon.

00:06:52.510 --> 00:06:55.500
Why would you act like a third wheel on a date?

00:06:55.650 --> 00:06:58.920
Hey, Rina. Where you are going for your next date?

00:06:59.070 --> 00:07:01.060
Can I tag along?

00:07:01.110 --> 00:07:03.030
There's not going to be a next date.

00:07:03.390 --> 00:07:05.220
I'm not going to see Masahiro any more.

00:07:05.270 --> 00:07:06.070
Eh?

00:07:06.240 --> 00:07:07.700
You're not going to see him any more?

00:07:07.830 --> 00:07:09.710
How come, Rina?

00:07:09.790 --> 00:07:12.550
I'm going to go to bed early. Good night.

00:07:14.130 --> 00:07:14.900
Good...

00:07:15.330 --> 00:07:16.270
...night.

00:07:18.110 --> 00:07:21.050
Hey, Lucia. What's going on?

00:07:21.150 --> 00:07:25.330
I think Rina feels sad after thinking about her future.

00:07:25.460 --> 00:07:27.730
What are you talking about when you say "future?"

00:07:27.810 --> 00:07:31.590
Well, we have to return to the sea one day, right?

00:07:31.690 --> 00:07:35.210
Even if that's the case, we don't have to do it right then and there!

00:07:35.570 --> 00:07:39.340
A guy who has his own yacht is a rare thing.

00:07:39.470 --> 00:07:43.350
Uhh, Hanon... I don't think that's the problem.

00:07:53.380 --> 00:07:54.430
Masahiro...

00:07:57.810 --> 00:07:58.790
Masahiro?

00:07:58.840 --> 00:08:01.420
No, it's not just that.

00:08:01.700 --> 00:08:07.470
Rina-chan, this place... is a place where I wanted to be able to take you to some day!

00:08:08.490 --> 00:08:11.650
This is also my favorite spot.

00:08:12.570 --> 00:08:17.520
Because this is the favorite spot for both of us, I'm really happy.

00:08:18.010 --> 00:08:18.980
Rina-chan.

00:08:23.670 --> 00:08:28.420
One day, I'll have to leave the land and return to the sea.

00:08:28.980 --> 00:08:32.860
That's the destiny for someone who is born a Mermaid Princess.

00:08:33.680 --> 00:08:37.840
I already knew this, and yet I ended up going out with Masahiro.

00:08:38.710 --> 00:08:43.250
I already knew this, and yet both Masahiro and I are going to end up being really sad.

00:08:44.830 --> 00:08:47.260
If we have to break up our relationship, the earlier the better...

00:08:48.480 --> 00:08:50.040
...before it gets too painful.

00:09:03.130 --> 00:09:04.660
Free concert!

00:09:04.890 --> 00:09:06.650
You can see an idol up close!

00:09:06.780 --> 00:09:07.770
Here you go!

00:09:08.510 --> 00:09:09.180
Okay.

00:09:09.330 --> 00:09:10.630
Would you like to go to a concert?

00:09:10.890 --> 00:09:14.640
"A grand performance at the gymnasium, free concert..."

00:09:22.170 --> 00:09:23.140
Hamasaki-san?

00:09:27.430 --> 00:09:28.340
Hamasaki-san?

00:09:29.160 --> 00:09:30.100
Lucia-chan...

00:09:30.310 --> 00:09:32.840
Mind if I sit here?

00:09:33.070 --> 00:09:34.720
Of course. Go ahead.

00:09:35.080 --> 00:09:38.500
Um... Rina told me a bit about what happened between you two.

00:09:39.960 --> 00:09:40.850
I see.

00:09:41.100 --> 00:09:45.260
I don't think that her saying that she didn't want to see you again are her true feelings.

00:09:45.320 --> 00:09:45.770
Eh?

00:09:46.000 --> 00:09:50.670
Rina truly wants to be with you, Hamasaki-san.

00:09:50.830 --> 00:09:52.590
Then why did Rina-chan say that?

00:09:52.740 --> 00:09:56.490
I'm sorry, but I can't say why she said that.

00:09:58.690 --> 00:10:00.930
I understand. Thank you, Lucia-chan.

00:10:06.880 --> 00:10:10.270
Now, work your hardest for me!

00:10:10.450 --> 00:10:12.370
You over there! Pick up the pace!

00:10:12.440 --> 00:10:13.410
You over there as well!

00:10:13.820 --> 00:10:18.360
Those who can't keep up will be {battered up}breaded and eaten!

00:10:18.520 --> 00:10:20.790
Moron! Moron!

00:10:23.570 --> 00:10:25.660
Lucia's running late.

00:10:25.790 --> 00:10:27.830
How long is she going to take to do the shopping?

00:10:28.110 --> 00:10:31.020
Is she trying to skip out on the cleaning?

00:10:31.380 --> 00:10:34.240
As for Rina, she's not coming out of her room.

00:10:35.060 --> 00:10:36.330
Welcome!

00:10:36.510 --> 00:10:39.730
Hamasaki-san! What is it?

00:10:40.010 --> 00:10:42.100
Hanon-chan, where's Rina-chan?

00:10:42.230 --> 00:10:44.930
Rina is in her room...

00:10:45.520 --> 00:10:47.000
Oh! Wait!

00:10:54.710 --> 00:10:56.820
Rina-chan! It's me, Masahiro!

00:10:57.110 --> 00:10:57.900
Open up!

00:10:58.300 --> 00:10:59.220
Masahiro...

00:11:00.420 --> 00:11:01.240
Go home!

00:11:01.600 --> 00:11:02.750
Open the door!

00:11:03.100 --> 00:11:04.380
I want to talk to you.

00:11:04.580 --> 00:11:07.030
I have nothing to say to you.

00:11:07.570 --> 00:11:09.200
Please go home.

00:11:09.660 --> 00:11:11.580
I'll go home after I've said what I want to say.

00:11:13.770 --> 00:11:15.560
I don't understand the {whole }situation.

00:11:16.220 --> 00:11:20.380
You said that you wanted to be with me. Was that just a lie?

00:11:20.560 --> 00:11:22.650
No! It isn't a lie!

00:11:22.650 --> 00:11:25.150
If it isn't a lie, then open the door!

00:11:41.540 --> 00:11:44.190
You said that we can't be together.

00:11:45.060 --> 00:11:50.670
Even though I don't know the entire situation, I'll go with you no matter how far you have to go.

00:11:50.950 --> 00:11:53.050
You can't do that.

00:11:53.580 --> 00:11:56.930
Weren't you supposed to be the successor to your father's business?

00:11:56.930 --> 00:11:58.410
I don't care about that!

00:11:58.990 --> 00:12:02.060
I'll give up everything just to be with you.

00:12:02.410 --> 00:12:03.540
Masahiro...

00:12:05.730 --> 00:12:09.350
I'm happy about your feelings, but it's still impossible.

00:12:09.510 --> 00:12:10.150
Why?

00:12:10.580 --> 00:12:16.250
I can't tell you everything, but I can tell you that we'll have to say goodbye one day.

00:12:16.700 --> 00:12:18.700
This will {not}never change.

00:12:19.360 --> 00:12:21.550
This is my fate.

00:12:22.090 --> 00:12:24.970
So, it would be better if we didn't see each other anymore.

00:12:25.280 --> 00:12:28.010
Otherwise, it'll be even more difficult when we do part ways.

00:12:28.900 --> 00:12:30.920
Rina-chan, you...

00:12:34.580 --> 00:12:36.970
Presented by Licca and Wasurenai-Fansubs

00:12:42.350 --> 00:12:44.650
Rina! Rina!

00:12:45.360 --> 00:12:48.940
Honestly, where did Rina go all of a sudden?

00:12:49.090 --> 00:12:49.960
Hanon!

00:12:50.040 --> 00:12:51.310
Oh, Lucia!

00:12:51.460 --> 00:12:53.840
What are you doing here?

00:12:54.170 --> 00:12:57.160
Just now, Hamasaki-san came to see Rina.

00:12:57.490 --> 00:13:00.120
Afterwards, he took Rina out somewhere.

00:13:00.320 --> 00:13:03.380
I'm a bit worried because she isn't back yet.

00:13:03.540 --> 00:13:07.010
I see. Let's go look for her together, then.

00:13:14.990 --> 00:13:17.670
Was there a gymnasium here before?

00:13:17.830 --> 00:13:19.610
I don't remember there being one.

00:13:20.250 --> 00:13:24.590
Maybe this is {the grand performance at the gymnasium.}the gymnasium where that performance is being held.

00:13:24.740 --> 00:13:27.830
They were handing out fliers in front of the train station which said something about this.

00:13:27.880 --> 00:13:33.140
Eh? Is that the grand performance exhibition that we've been seeing on TV?

00:13:33.420 --> 00:13:34.210
Probably.

00:13:34.490 --> 00:13:35.620
Hey, Lucia.

00:13:35.770 --> 00:13:37.170
Wanna take a look?

00:13:37.400 --> 00:13:39.700
Huh? {Goodness gracious}Come on, Hanon!

00:13:39.780 --> 00:13:42.450
Weren't you out here to find Rina and Hamasaki-san?

00:13:42.970 --> 00:13:45.700
Just a little bit, please!

00:13:45.820 --> 00:13:48.200
Fine, fine. You leave me with no choice.

00:13:56.640 --> 00:13:59.830
This is for the best, for Masahiro...

00:14:07.130 --> 00:14:09.940
Was there a gymnasium here before?

00:14:10.090 --> 00:14:14.200
Alala! Alala! Alala!

00:14:14.360 --> 00:14:17.090
Alala! Alala!

00:14:37.780 --> 00:14:39.930
Ugh! How is it her again...

00:14:40.080 --> 00:14:43.530
It's Alala. What's she planning this time?

00:14:45.010 --> 00:14:50.540
Maybe she just really wanted to sing.

00:15:19.200 --> 00:15:20.910
Everyone, can I have your attention.

00:15:21.400 --> 00:15:24.180
To tell you the truth, I have some sad news to tell.

00:15:24.460 --> 00:15:28.160
This is the last time I'll be seeing everyone.

00:15:28.570 --> 00:15:29.460
That's because...

00:15:29.540 --> 00:15:35.150
...today is the day that I'm going to bury the Mermaid Princesses and everyone in this gymnasium alive!

00:15:35.260 --> 00:15:36.610
That little...

00:15:36.840 --> 00:15:37.960
Here we go!

00:15:44.620 --> 00:15:48.990
The Super Idol of the new era, Alala-chan, is here!

00:15:49.170 --> 00:15:51.340
I'm starting!

00:16:13.180 --> 00:16:14.760
What in the world is that?

00:16:39.670 --> 00:16:41.200
Lucia! Hanon!

00:16:41.330 --> 00:16:42.150
Rina!

00:16:42.220 --> 00:16:43.680
What's going on here?

00:16:43.750 --> 00:16:45.220
Alala is the cause of this!

00:17:35.080 --> 00:17:36.790
Pink Pearl Voice!

00:17:40.330 --> 00:17:42.040
Aqua Pearl Voice!

00:17:44.520 --> 00:17:46.330
Green Pearl Voice!

00:17:47.110 --> 00:17:49.980
Mermaid Princesses! So you were here.

00:17:50.110 --> 00:17:52.230
The plan was a success!

00:17:52.510 --> 00:17:56.670
How dare you bring innocent people into this!

00:17:56.920 --> 00:17:58.710
We'll punish you with our Pichi Pichi Voices!

00:17:58.890 --> 00:18:02.100
Isn't it enough that we showed up?

00:18:02.260 --> 00:18:03.920
Now stop this destruction!

00:18:03.990 --> 00:18:11.470
Oh my! Sorry, but once it started, it won't stop until all its power is used.

00:19:05.090 --> 00:19:07.540
All right, let's go!

00:19:07.820 --> 00:19:11.160
Pichi Pichi Voice Live Start!

00:19:46.540 --> 00:19:50.160
I'm sorry! Save me, senpai!

00:20:15.220 --> 00:20:19.000
Oh my! Alala in pain is also really cute!

00:20:23.770 --> 00:20:26.700
Love Shower Pitch!

00:20:29.540 --> 00:20:31.200
How about an encore?

00:20:31.480 --> 00:20:37.220
For the birth of a new world, hurry up and become taiyaki!

00:20:40.210 --> 00:20:43.830
Sheesh! Alala went too far this time!

00:20:43.980 --> 00:20:47.730
But everyone inside got out safely.

00:20:48.140 --> 00:20:49.320
Thank goodness.

00:20:49.390 --> 00:20:50.110
That's...

00:20:53.320 --> 00:20:54.090
Masahiro!

00:21:00.490 --> 00:21:01.340
Masahiro!

00:21:01.570 --> 00:21:02.540
Rina!

00:21:19.430 --> 00:21:21.400
Rina-chan... where am I?

00:21:23.510 --> 00:21:25.120
Did you save me, Rina-chan?

00:21:27.880 --> 00:21:29.690
What's wrong, Rina-chan?

00:21:29.920 --> 00:21:34.110
Masahiro, I thought that you were going to die!

00:21:35.820 --> 00:21:38.600
I'm relieved! I'm so relieved!

00:21:39.180 --> 00:21:39.850
Rina-chan...

00:21:47.580 --> 00:21:48.320
Masahiro.

00:21:49.390 --> 00:21:50.260
Rina!

00:21:51.080 --> 00:21:52.560
I'm never going to let you go ever again.

00:21:53.170 --> 00:21:53.830
Masahiro...

00:21:58.100 --> 00:22:00.900
Hold me... embrace me even tighter.

00:22:00.980 --> 00:22:03.070
Never let me go!

00:22:04.300 --> 00:22:05.060
Rina...

00:22:05.500 --> 00:22:06.340
Masahiro...

00:23:50.920 --> 00:23:53.370
Thanks for today.{Thank you very much.} I had a lot of fun.

00:23:54.090 --> 00:23:59.010
Hey, Nagisa... at that time, I really loved Tarou-chan.

00:23:59.400 --> 00:24:01.920
All I could think about was Tarou-chan.

00:24:02.250 --> 00:24:05.320
Even if I talked with him for a little bit, I felt really happy.

00:24:05.800 --> 00:24:09.390
I thought that those feelings would never change.

00:24:10.340 --> 00:24:13.390
Next time on Mermaid Melody Pichi Pichi Pitch Pure:

00:24:13.980 --> 00:24:15.360
The Last Love Letter.

00:24:15.950 --> 00:24:20.170
Do you want to know what my feelings are now, Nagisa?
